  <name>AsOne</name>
  <summary>Product photos for the web, in one batch</summary>
  <summary xml:lang="pl">Zdjęcia produktowe do internetu – cała paczka naraz</summary>
  <developer id="io.github.lucasterg">
    <name>LucasTerg</name>
  </developer>
  <description>
    <p>
      AsOne prepares a batch of product photos for an online shop: crop, margins,
      white background, square 1:1, background removal, URL-friendly file names
      and a metadata-free progressive JPEG export that respects size limits.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>GPU preview with zoom, crop, eraser and rectangle cut-outs</li>
      <li>Background removal with local BRIA RMBG models (ONNX)</li>
      <li>Export limits enforced on every save (e.g. 3000×3600 px, 3 MB)</li>
      <li>CLI and MCP server for automation</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
